  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{4:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<style=title><size=42>Catch the Turkey Feature\r\n</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<style=title><size=42>Free Games\r\n</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=20>- Each Gobble Gobble spin is part of a 10 spin game cycle. \n-
      A counter near the reels displays the current spin out of 10.\n- Spin increases
      sequentially until reaching 10, then the game starts over from 1. \n\n- After
      reel stop, any              appearing on the reels turns into            , which
      gets locked into position.\n\n- On the 10th spin, all positions with the            frames
      turn into             .\n\n- Line wins are calculated after any and all symbol
      transformations.\n\n- If on the 10th spin, 3 Scatters appear in or outside of
      \           , trigger Free Games first before turning\n   the position to Wild.\n\n-
      \           only turn positions to             where they aren't already
      a locked            . "
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=20>- During Free Games, the special expanding symbol may expand
      to \ncover 3 positions on the reel.\n- Special expanding symbol will pay like
      regular symbol, but even on \nnon-adjacent positions and on all lines played.\n-
      Expanding is only triggered if there are enough symbols present to \ncreate
      a win."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.

      - Jackpots are available for qualifying bets only.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: "<size=24>Bet Per Line: 1\r\n</size>"
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Gobble Gobble
  - key: PUMPJACK_JACKPOT_CREDIT
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: SPECIAL_SYMBOL_COLLECT_COUNT
    value: '{0}'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: "<style=title><size=42>Thanksgiving Jackpot\r\r\n</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=20>- 3 Scatters in the base reels triggers Free Games.\r\n- 10 Free
      Games is played with 2 sets of reels.\r\n- The 10 spin game counter is reset
      to 1 when Free Games begins.\r\n- If 3 Scatters appears in either of the reel
      set, Free Games is re-triggered.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: "<size=20>- During Free Games, all             are accumulated to determine
      Jackpots.\r\n- There are 4 Jackpots. Accumulate the             needed in each
      level to win the next biggest Jackpot.\r\n- Jackpot will be awarded when Free
      Games ends.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_3
    value: "<size=22><color=#88d3f8><b>Level 1\n\n<size=24><color=#ffba00>40</style></b>
      \               <size=20><color=#ffffff>=>                          = 20x Total
      Bet\r</size></color>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_4
    value: "<size=22><color=#88d3f8><b>Level 2\n\n<size=24><color=#ffba00>30</style></b>
      \               <size=20><color=#ffffff>=>                          = 100x Total
      Bet\r</size></color>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_5
    value: "<size=22><color=#88d3f8><b>Level 3\n\n<size=24><color=#ffba00>30</style></b>
      \               <size=20><color=#ffffff>=>                          = 500x Total
      Bet\r</size></color>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_6
    value: "<size=22><color=#88d3f8><b>Level 4\n\n<size=24><color=#ffba00>50</style></b>
